[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_05_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_05_0010","text":"一、二、三、四\n五、六、七、八……————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_05_0020","text":"One、Two……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_05_0030","text":"不对。上次也是手臂的角度……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_05_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_05_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_05_0040","text":"（……果然\n　上次练习时这里就没做好。）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_05_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_05_0050","text":"“一、二、三、四\n　五、六、七、八……————”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_05_0060","text":"（表情紧绷绷的，一点余裕都没有……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_05_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_05_0070","text":"（要是旁边的人看到我这种表情在练习，\n　会更不安的吧……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_05_0080","text":"（明明和她们俩相处的过程中，\n　应该改变了很多的……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_05_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_05_0090","text":"……一点都没成长啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_05_0100","text":"……练习……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_05_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_05_0110","text":"“我去跟Producer先生商量了，\n　看能不能增加三个人一起练习的时间。”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_05_0120","text":"“他说要一起重新调整日程。”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_05_0130","text":"“真乃谢谢你！！！”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_05_0140","text":"“我明天会见到Producer，\n　到时候直接跟他谈谈！”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_05_0150","text":"“灯织酱、巡酱，\n　一起加油吧。”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_05_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_05_0160","text":"“三个人一起。”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_05_0170","text":"真乃……巡……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_05_0180","text":"……好耀眼啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_05_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_05_0190","text":"……嗯，没问题了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01010200_05_0200","text":"一、二、三、四……────"}]
